-- bpmn-typically-hence.l4 with the HENCE passing FALSE, the opposite of the
-- callee's default. The BPMN document is the same as with TRUE, and nothing
-- is reported about the default: the source supplies the value here, so the
-- default is not what the process lost.
DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Filer
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF file, acknowledge

GIVEN `is complete` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the acknowledgement` MEANS
    PARTY Filer
    MUST acknowledge
    PROVIDED `is complete`
    WITHIN 7

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the filing` MEANS
    PARTY Filer
    MUST file
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE `the acknowledgement` FALSE
